# A variable that every turn assigns before it reads it once got a parameter at the head of the loop all the same: it entered as undefined and came round as what the turn assigned: wider: the walk was undone and made again for a parameter that nothing read. The front end makes a parameter of a head by the first read that meets it: here none does, the head has no such parameter, and the walk fits at once.
